<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E45649;--shiki-dark:#E06C75;">    url</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">: </span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">https://oapi.dingtalk.com/robot/send?access_token=&lt;access_token&gt;</span></span>
